cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "alligator-py: Allen Transformer"
abstract: >-
  Python port of the alligator Allen Transformer. Reads an Alligator file
  (*.agt) holding correspondence-analysis coordinates and partly unknown
  absolute dates, dates the floating intervals from their nearest fixed
  neighbours in CA space, derives the Allen interval relations between all
  events and exports them as RDF/Turtle, Academic Meta Tool Turtle, Neo4j
  Cypher and interactive views.
